#20500
The Path Down the Ridge~
   A switchback path drops down the western face of the ridge toward the
river valley. Below you the fortress sits on the near bank, its walls
scarred and patched, its tower flying a faded banner. Across the river, the
far bank is one great camp of grey tents and grey shapes.
~
