#20501
Before the Fortress~
   A killing ground of churned earth lies before the fortress gate, studded
with stakes and ditches. The bones of past assaults are trodden into the
mud. Archers watch from the walls. The gate opens only when the watch on the
tower has looked you over through a spyglass.
