#20502
The Gate of Fort Lastlight~
   A gatehouse of black stone, its doors sheathed in iron and dented by
rams. Burning oil has scorched the walls above it. A sergeant stands in the
gateway with a ledger, writing down the name of every living soul who comes
in, because so few of them do.
