#20504
The Fortress Wall~
   The top of the wall, where archers stand shoulder to shoulder behind the
merlons. Across the river the enemy's campfires burn in their thousands. Now
and then a stone from a siege engine whistles over and bursts against the
wall, and the archers duck and come up and shoot again.
