#20507
The Keep Cellars~
   Storerooms under the keep, mostly empty. A few sacks of meal, a barrel of
salt fish, crates of arrows. The quartermaster counts them every morning and
every evening, and every evening there are fewer, though no one has eaten.
Rats have come. Grey ones.
~
