#20509
The River Wall~
   The fortress's western wall runs along the river bank, and from it a
stone ramp leads down to the bridgehead. The bridge was the realm's pride,
nine great arches across the river. Three of them are gone now, blown up by
the garrison to stop the West from crossing.
~
