#20510
The Bridgehead~
   A fortified gatehouse guards the eastern end of the bridge. The span runs
out over the grey river and stops in ragged stone where the arches were
blown. The enemy has thrown a bridge of bones and timber across the gap, and
every night they try to cross it.
