#20512
The Bone Bridge~
   Lashed timbers and the long bones of men and horses form a swaying span
over the gap. Skulls are tied along its edges as handholds. Grey soldiers
cross it each night to assault the bridgehead, and few of them return. The
far bank is close now, and loud with drums.
