#20516
The Far Bank~
   You stand on the western bank of the river, in the enemy's country. The
ground is grey and dead. The West's siege camp spreads out before you: tents
of grey hide, bone totems, cages, cookfires where things roast that you do
not look at closely. Drums beat without stopping.
~
