#20517
The Ruins of Riversmeet~
   The town of Riversmeet stood on the far bank for five hundred years. Now
it is rubble and ash, its people hollowed and marched west or roasted on the
enemy's fires. The enemy uses its houses as barracks. Grey banners hang from
the old guildhall.
~
