The Heart of the Siege Camp~
   The centre of the enemy camp, where the grey host's champions gather
around a great fire of bones. Drummers pound skin drums. Dread hounds the
size of horses lie chained to stakes. At the head of the fire, on a throne
of shields taken from the dead, sits the commander of the siege.
