#20523
The Bridgebreaker's Mound~
   A mound of earth and rubble raised by slaves, from which the siege's
commander can watch the fortress. A giant figure stands upon it, armoured in
iron plates bolted to its flesh, a hammer the size of a door across its
shoulders. It broke the bridge's arches with that hammer, and it will break
the walls.
~
