#20524
The Edge of the Blight~
   West of the siege camp, the grey ground runs on into a waste where
nothing grows at all. The sky darkens. The wind carries fine ash that stings
the eyes. This is where the Blight begins, and beyond this point, no
fortress of the living has ever stood.
~
